        "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/upc-pre-202620-1asi0730-8088-FrioTrackk/report-friotrack/zipball/v2.0.0",
        "body": "# FríoTrack Project Report v2.0.0\n\nConsolidated TB1 version of the FríoTrack project report.\n\n## Included\n\n- Corrected table of contents and links to the team's current repositories.\n- Updated version history, collaboration records and Student Outcome evidence.\n- Sprint 2 documentation covering planning, responsibilities, backlog, development, execution, services, deployment and collaboration.\n- Backlog identifiers aligned with shipment planning, lifecycle, corrective actions and cargo-client access.\n- Email/password sign-in and server authorization documented for both user roles.\n- Azure deployment URLs, execution screenshots and verification records.\n- Architecture diagrams aligned with the deployed supporting API and its private JSON store; relational backend evolution identified separately.\n- Restored editable architecture sources, visual-design assets and HTML prototype.\n- Updated conclusions, bibliography and delivery annexes.\n\n## Validation\n\nInternal Markdown targets and anchors resolve; all eight Sprint 2 subsections are present. The catalog contains 43 stories, with 75 SP across 20 Sprint 2 stories. Existing receipts record 15 frontend domain tests, 26 local API checks and 12 deployed HTTPS checks, each with its own scope.\n\n## Related products\n\n- [FríoTrack Landing Page](https://friotracktb1bce6db1b.z22.web.core.windows.net/landing/)\n- [FríoTrack Web Application](https://friotracktb1bce6db1b.z22.web.core.windows.net/)\n- [FríoTrack Frontend source and supporting API](https://github.com/upc-pre-202620-1asi0730-8088-FrioTrackk/friotrack-frontend)\n\n## Delivery annexes\n\nThe report identifies the planning/review records, narrated videos, team presentation and Team Leader assessment that still need to be attached. Operational seed records are test data; physical sensors and the final relational/OpenAPI backend are outside this implementation.\n\n**Full changelog:** [1.0.0...v2.0.0](https://github.com/upc-pre-202620-1asi0730-8088-FrioTrackk/report-friotrack/compare/1.0.0...v2.0.0)\n"
      },
