        "body": "## Features\r\n\r\n- Add email and password sign-in for logistics coordinators and cargo clients.\r\n- Integrate an ASP.NET Core API for authentication, sessions and role-based permissions.\r\n- Restrict cargo clients to their assigned shipments and associated resources.\r\n- Connect shipment, fleet, alert and profile operations to the API.\r\n- Add cargo-client registration and server-side session revocation on sign-out.\r\n- Replace the sample-profile selector and remove academic labels from the interface.\r\n- Update English and Spanish content for the authenticated user flows.\r\n- Deploy the frontend and supporting API to Microsoft Azure.\r\n- Add deployment documentation, screenshots and verification records.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- Pass 15 frontend domain tests and 26 API integration checks.\r\n- Build the Vue frontend and publish the ASP.NET Core API successfully.\r\n- Verify that the compiled frontend matches the version deployed on Azure.\r\n\r\n**Full changelog:** [d944ba1...dc49d7e](https://github.com/upc-pre-202620-1asi0730-8088-FrioTrackk/friotrack-frontend/compare/d944ba1...dc49d7e)"
      },
